docs/course-production/PLAYBOOK.md:179:| 9.1 | **Two-phase beat: Andrea must take over the frame when the anim clip ENDS, not at a separate `andreaCut`.** If the anim clip is shorter than `andreaCut` (clip 361f@24fps ≈ 451 frame-slots vs cut 713), the P1 sequence ends and P2 hasn't started → a **blank-blue gap** (just the pill) mid-beat. Fix: `const p1End = Math.min(cut, p1Len)`; play anim `from 0 dur p1End`, Andrea `from p1End`. Verify the Andrea clip is long enough to cover `dur - p1End` | b05a ~8.7s + b06a ~1.4s blank gaps, caught in QC (proof stills sampled INSIDE the anim window and missed it) |
